Description: One-button ThingBot arcade games for NEO One (ThingEdu)
 NeoArcade is a set of motion arcade games for the NEO One education
 device (ARM64/Armbian) and standard Linux desktops, controlled by a
 single ThingBot arcade button over UART (with a keyboard fallback).
 .
 Games: FlappyDe, Đua Xe Dế, Bóng Rổ and Đấm Bốc — playful physical
 activity built around the Dế Foundation Blue Economy theme.
